==Icelandic==
{{Icelandic declension kk sb dagur|afmælis}}

===Etymology===
From {{term|afmælis|lang=is}} the genitive of {{term|afmæli||birthday|lang=is}} + {{term|dagur||day|lang=is}}. Literally means "day of a birthday" or "birthday day".

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|[ˈavmaiːlɪsˌd̥aːɣʏr]}} (correctly) or {{IPA|[ˈamːaiːlɪsˌd̥aːɣʏr]}} (colloquially)

===Noun===
